            <div xml:id="m-b386144b-4f9a-4065-b61b-dfa6d3f11b3d">
              <lg xml:id="m-1ad89bc8-8d8d-4a52-ad70-e7d4a6009e86">
                <l xml:id="m-a5f595e5-d6c4-4cbb-80e2-6a5f6059fe28" facs="#m-250dd47f-845e-4bdf-901e-b19d449de259" label="ambiguous">356</l><l xml:id="m-f98c7ac5-e543-4750-a805-b0a4a6d7d895" facs="#m-9c0d01e5-eb5a-4449-8487-3f188c00402a" label="text-like">4th Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-6bc836e9-3bc4-40f3-9c48-e11538493c76" facs="#m-0eb121de-37e4-4cfb-8eb3-43bbca7efc59" label="ambiguous">comm.)</l><l xml:id="m-34f53bad-ea4e-4cee-9b64-46f8de572ea7" facs="#m-34cf3dbd-4e48-4ba4-a69d-d52a0d568d87" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-db3ae7e6-f46e-4ca0-a5f2-f094e68912bc" facs="#m-7989942e-9e53-4d9e-96f9-a0d606882b4e" label="lyrics-like">ri-et fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5617a94-5f93-45fb-8685-2157eec277fe" facs="#m-fe33355a-e9d2-4433-b34c-86e47ecbad62" label="lyrics-like">Cce vírgo“ concí-pi¬et,</l><l xml:id="m-694473ec-e4a4-405a-8a16-a1ae365981d2" facs="#m-bfc2a190-0174-41cc-9da1-9ba1c0266326" label="lyrics-like">et pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d765547-6ac4-457c-ba6a-6923f6022c22" facs="#m-54ac7fa0-f96e-457e-810d-16078a473b99" label="lyrics-like">jus Emmá-nu¬ el</l><l xml:id="m-07d15680-7d2d-4906-82d6-f6fd000871d7" facs="#m-0999d9ab-f3c3-40e5-ab7f-033ba36f85e8" label="lyrics-like">li- um: et vo-cá-bi- tur nómen é¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ea9dd7e-d210-4565-ade1-19e1bd0bc729" facs="#m-03687bf6-7e56-40e6-bb8d-d8684e4f8b02" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ecbff1b5-9d07-42ac-959f-e8eac6c0f510" facs="#m-8ec27e5d-44a8-4214-a861-0d7d4e118c23" label="lyrics-like">(Umptis munéribus, quaésumus! mystérii, crescat nostrae salútis</l><l xml:id="m-0dcaf72d-5682-4818-a3bd-3771d4e817d1" facs="#m-1fcd4e81-cc5c-4315-b71e-6123b5146a3d" label="lyrics-like">O Dómine, ut cum frequentatióne! efféctus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-03ea3efc-5eac-4529-839d-5051fc84a9af" facs="#m-05a1eba4-3d8c-40bd-b801-2af44d66574e" label="text-like">The other Postcommunions are as on the rst Sunday of Advent, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-6d99b572-8574-412d-a933-a0959897acd4" facs="#m-7616aef3-0f3d-4988-b497-a167bc3ea7b1" label="text-like">If Christmas Eve falls on the ath Sunday of Advent, the Mass is said</l><l xml:id="m-804e64d0-b139-4f0f-9c79-9794c04b9bd4" facs="#m-26efb1da-be18-46b1-9086-3ce8a4a85c05" label="text-like">of that Vigil with aCommemoration of the Sunday, but the Gospel</l><l xml:id="m-a26f5268-009d-4222-83f7-ce08ac6eefaa" facs="#m-58a2d1f8-133e-4ecd-b431-a8649b5a0bcc" label="text-like">of the Sunday is not read at the end. At the Little Hours, the Office is also</l><l xml:id="m-2a82cd25-1a48-4198-97c0-065a92214684" facs="#m-61004098-fe0c-49e6-a09a-45b62e466faf" label="text-like">of Christmas Eve.</l><l xml:id="m-6f6bd68f-4731-46ec-8fb9-caf316f5ed6c" facs="#m-9b18c02e-d48c-496a-8569-aaa22d30a513" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-13834164-579d-4deb-84aa-205d45d9909c" facs="#m-b4faca55-c1c9-49ce-8106-0e1f5dc62b95" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Erunt práva. p. 357.</l><l xml:id="m-46637809-b7f2-40fc-93e2-4cde912b98df" facs="#m-a3d3f925-4283-4723-9a2c-df83618d6b28" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-ea765071-f95c-4642-a8ed-e1a84c7fa1cb" facs="#m-c25bf3e8-b5f0-4909-91b2-82d956ab0af8" label="ambiguous">1. Cor. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-7063a5e6-1707-472b-8f92-38a1813d3d42" facs="#m-ff5ce9d2-dfda-479a-8e24-d5efd8fb985e" label="lyrics-like">Ihi autem pro mínimo est, ut máno die:“sed neque meipsum</l><l xml:id="m-06337d57-803c-48a5-abcb-66e727de492b" facs="#m-08a2824b-d2db-4a31-b13e-e66d15c7d6b0" label="lyrics-like">31 a vobis júdicer, t aut ab hu- júdico.</l><l xml:id="m-eca7e6f3-7cc7-4f3f-ade7-97f53fc9a58d" facs="#m-2459ab69-87d0-4593-81ab-dad689763fcf" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Osténde nóbis Dómine. p. 243. V. Meménto.</l><l xml:id="m-30386b7e-3511-4556-89f5-bbcff1359e80" facs="#m-cd9d0f75-5905-4c15-9232-a991f0d69818" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-4819b7f1-ec67-4d08-b7ba-0efafc9a2cae" facs="#m-a02c5b30-77db-4a52-98d5-442002676a28" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Omnípotens. p. 357.</l><l xml:id="m-9a322848-4aab-430f-a610-ec6031cb24a1" facs="#m-2ef9863d-5883-4912-815e-7951001b7bd0" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-341db2be-6a87-41ca-85e2-98b46f90c238" facs="#m-4c35106e-7c74-4b2f-90b9-7f72321138dc" label="ambiguous">r. Cor. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-2b9dfa03-d158-4aa1-8569-556a610d5394" facs="#m-1928ac81-9770-4130-872e-03cd15f90385" label="lyrics-like">Taque nolîte ante tempus judi- tenebrárum, et manifestábit con¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bd80ccc-e61f-4368-844a-ae219e00cb23" facs="#m-d2314453-d34d-42a1-9df4-a373703c99b6" label="lyrics-like">L cáre, quoadúsque véniat Dõmi- sslia córdium:*et tunc laus erit</l><l xml:id="m-23bc25fc-cb19-4899-9eb7-22cb4a0a7fa4" facs="#m-8fee19d5-57cc-4806-8265-4d067892d201" label="lyrics-like">nus:t quí et illuminábit abscóndita! unicuique a Deo.</l><l xml:id="m-74a36769-af9b-4958-b04b-2c4421886937" facs="#m-2836a87f-beb9-402d-88bd-5cf496de5f27" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Super te Jerúsalem. p. 248. V. Véni Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-375371e3-130d-4475-a98b-e0a6295b3127" facs="#m-5be1a8b3-da38-4304-a649-6b0a148dd29d" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-46afe48e-dcb1-4724-b0fb-13dd42780bbf" facs="#m-8e464f42-eef3-4f3a-a0d5-ba3bed2e8cc9" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. I. g. 128. — 2. Confitébor. 1. f. 183.—</l><l xml:id="m-c4e36088-9f17-4e47-86de-75756cd249ba" facs="#m-e7e790c4-ee37-4796-bd97-202afbd5efb6" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. I. g. 140. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 1. f. 148. — 5. In éxitu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7255a09-aa01-4bfb-b530-ea6b53e55d9a" facs="#m-3e6f97a2-32bc-44af-b1bb-23a14b26b16a" label="ambiguous">2 D. 153.</l><l xml:id="m-e29281c2-27e2-4029-bbc3-0a8a6150a4ef" facs="#m-786daaf3-9346-4136-81a5-749aa2ba36b3" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.2</l><l xml:id="m-8be23733-ebae-45fb-adca-2027aa9c9e6c" facs="#m-7a3b11ef-b4dd-469c-865b-37a8bec917b0" label="ambiguous">1.8</l><l xml:id="m-cc14ddce-5f7d-46d6-8778-8003ec610107" facs="#m-1bdf0e39-b174-4172-bc36-fdedd9477ea1" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-43895a62-8483-4e09-86ae-c1bd7b54b55a" facs="#m-4137e08d-036c-472f-bc2b-1ccb9740ddfa" label="lyrics-like">Ani-te tú-ba" in Si- on, qui-a prope est dí-es</l><l xml:id="m-6f5f7bbf-d03e-4307-b972-62b6bddba625" facs="#m-21c1d80e-a8af-4a37-b91c-e75dbe5af03e" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-871e8c52-3a34-43e2-b706-1ef6440085be" facs="#m-ec4ae2c1-2c5e-4ee2-aa7a-e30f1eabf37e" label="ambiguous">mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff97a7be-fdde-47d9-86b5-4ee62e85792d" facs="#m-65b4fec4-07c9-4b10-9766-513d7093332e" label="ambiguous">ni:</l><l xml:id="m-b68c997e-ffde-44fd-adce-0558eae90828" facs="#m-97ef18cb-b211-48ed-90c3-7c96e3ba2ea7" label="lyrics-like">ecce vémi-et ad salvándum nos,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
